<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
    <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> Commentary decks</p>
    <h1 class="bhero-title">The commented texts, with their commentators</h1>
    <p class="bhero-lede">Read a distinction of Lombard's Sentences, a question of Aquinas's Summa, a title of the Decretals or a distinction or causa of Gratian's Decretum beside any commentator the library holds on it, each with his own questions and articles; a disputation of Voetius beside the other Reformed disputations, a chapter of Vitringa's aphorisms with Martin Vitringa's notes, or a locus of Gerhard (or Calov) beside the Lutheran systems; or a place of theology (God, Christ, justification, the Church) across the systems of theology. Either pane can hold a commentator or a system, so two can be compared.</p>
  </div>
</section>
